      "description": "The only smart flashcard app built specifically for the Madinah Arabic books.\n\nIf you are studying the Madinah Arabic Reader series (Books 1, 2, and 3) from the Islamic University of Madinah, this app is made for you. Every lesson from all three books is preloaded as its own deck — just select your lesson and start reviewing.\n\nSMART SPACED REPETITION\n\nPowered by the SM-2 algorithm (the same system behind Anki), the app learns how well you know each word and schedules your next review at exactly the right time — so you study smarter, not harder.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED\n\n•\tAll vocabulary from Madinah Arabic Books 1, 2, and 3\n•\tStudy one lesson or combine multiple\n•\tArabic script, transliteration, and English translation on every card\n•\tAgain / Hard / Good / Easy rating buttons after each card\n•\tProgress tracked per card across sessions\n•\tBrowse mode to review vocabulary by lesson\n•\t100% offline — no internet connection required\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nSelect the lessons you want to review - a single lesson, a range, or the full book. Each card shows the Arabic word. Tap to flip and reveal the English meaning. Then rate how easily you recalled it: Again, Hard, Good, or Easy. The app schedules your next review automatically. Cards you find difficult come back sooner. Words you know well are spaced further apart. Over time, every word moves from short-term to long-term memory.\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\n•\tStudents of the Madinah Arabic textbook series\n•\tAnyone learning Arabic to understand the Quran\n•\tMosque and Islamic school students\n•\tSelf-taught Arabic learners following the Madinah curriculum\n•\tTeachers looking for a digital companion to the books\n\nCOMPLETELY FREE, COMPLETELY OFFLINE\n\nNo subscription. No account required. No internet connection needed. All content and all progress is stored on your device. Your data is yours.",
